# EasyGrade local environment. Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env (it is git-ignored).
#
# Used by: easygrade/pipeline/grader/ (smoke.py, grade.py) and easygrade/eval/chart_check.py.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/. Keep it on your own laptop only.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Not set here, on purpose:
# - max_video_seconds and redact_names live in easygrade/config/assignment.json.
# - Whisper runs locally and needs no key (it needs ffmpeg installed).
# - Real student files, names and grades never go in this file or in git (FERPA).
